# Web client

- Typed commands are the canonical interaction. Panels may assist; they must not replace the vocabulary.
- React components never contain game rules.
- Apply server events to presentation state. Do not invent authoritative outcomes.
- Keep classic mode fully playable. Colour, HUD, and effects are progressive.
- Do not communicate essential information through colour alone.
- Respect reduced motion. Keep a permanent transcript of important events.
